|                       + HELP --------------------------------- confirm mode ---+                       |
|                       |Global                                                  |                       |
|                       | q          Quit                                        |                       |
|                       | Ctrl-C     Quit safely from any mode                   |                       |
|                       | Esc        Close the overlay or cancel the current mode|                       |
|                       |Process control                                         |                       |
|                       | Enter / y  Confirm the pending action                  |                       |
|                       | Y          Confirm a forceful action such as SIGKILL   |                       |
|                       | n          Cancel without acting                       |                       |
|                       | j / Down   Next choice                                 |                       |
|                       | k / Up     Previous choice                             |                       |
